MUSIC AND SOUNDS. All music and sound effects of the game (the files
`assets/audio/tracks/*.wav` and `assets/audio/sfx/*.wav`) were made for the
project and belong to the copyright holder on the same terms as the code. They
are synthesised by the project's generators from the maths recorded in this
repository: they contain no sample, no downloaded recording and no borrowed
melody. A copyright notice is embedded in every WAV file (a RIFF `LIST/INFO`
chunk), so the ownership of a file can be established outside the game as well.
Using the music or the sounds apart from the game - in your own videos, games,
builds or other projects - requires the written permission of the rights
holder.

